1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,300
(Sheldon:)from Buckland.

2
00:00:01,301 --> 00:00:03,371
(Sheldon:)And I roll...

3
00:00:08,275 --> 00:00:10,145
(Sheldon:)a five and a three.

4
00:00:10,143 --> 00:00:11,443
(Bernadette:)Okay.

5
00:00:11,445 --> 00:00:16,115
(Leonard:)And to defend, I roll...

6
00:00:16,116 --> 00:00:18,016
(Leonard:)two sixes. I win.

7
00:00:18,018 --> 00:00:21,318
(Sheldon:)Boy, double-sixes again.

8
00:00:21,321 --> 00:00:22,951
(Leonard:)You know...
if I hadn't seen it

9
00:00:22,956 --> 00:00:24,686
(Sheldon:)with my own eyes,
I wouldn't believe it.

10
00:00:26,126 --> 00:00:28,996
(Sheldon:)I wonder how long
we're gonna be stuck here.

11
00:00:28,996 --> 00:00:30,826
(Leonard:)I don't know, but the girls
do a lot for us.

12
00:00:30,831 --> 00:00:32,131
(Leonard:)It's the least we can do.

13
00:00:32,132 --> 00:00:34,132
(Sheldon:)Oh, that's true.
I suppose it's only fair

14
00:00:34,134 --> 00:00:35,804
(Sheldon:)we make compromises.

15
00:00:35,802 --> 00:00:38,172
(Leonard:)Look at you,
being all mature.

16
00:00:38,171 --> 00:00:42,311
(Sheldon:)I don't know why
you're so surprised.

17
00:00:42,309 --> 00:00:43,979
(Sheldon:)If there's one thing I know
about after living with you

18
00:00:43,977 --> 00:00:47,117
(Sheldon:)for so many years,
it's how to compromise.

19
00:00:47,981 --> 00:00:50,051
I-I'm sorry?

20
00:00:50,050 --> 00:00:52,220
(Leonard:)You make compromises for me?

21
00:00:53,554 --> 00:00:55,284
(Sheldon:)All the time.

22
00:00:56,557 --> 00:01:00,027
(Leonard:)On Earth?

